<span id="A4.F11.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:369.9pt;">
<span id="A4.F11.2.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">If none fit, choose E. If more than one fits, pick the best.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.F11.2.20" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.F11.2.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:2.5pt 2.3pt;">
